{
 "schema": "hyperspace.preset/2",
 "name": "MACRO PERFORMANCE",
 "note": "Eight knobs for a whole set on one scene (D1-D8 = macro 1-8). 1 INTENSITY calm to wild: the music's grip on every plane and input, glow and FX mix. 2 SCALE small and many to big and few, camera in and out with it. 3 TEMPO half-time to double-time motion everywhere. 4 HUE WALK one turn of the palette, colour and the hue cycle richer as it goes. 5 TIGHT soft and smeared to crisp and punchy. 6 SPACE a 3D tumble to a deep turn through W. 7 BREAKDOWN pulls everything back (up) and releases it (down). 8 DROP slams every route and scatters the faces. 1-6 rest at noon, 7-8 at zero.",
